<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Neogen buy reiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Neogen buy reiterated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Roney &amp; Co analyst Lynn Malkes said Wednesday she reiterated her buy recommendation on Neogen Corp.</p>
<p>-- Neogen has a product line of more than 140 diagnostic test kits for food safety, plant diseases, animal health, pharmacologic research and human clinical testing.</p>
<p>-- Malkes estimates Neogen earnings at $0.28 a share for fiscal 1997 and $0.36 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- Neogen shares were up 1/4 at 7-1/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
